\emph default
 indicates whether the corresponding metric should be used at a global or local scale to either study macro or micro behaviors within the ensemble of local expert agents;
 The columns 
\emph on
Explain.

\emph default
 and 
\emph on
Intepret.

\emph default
 correspond to whether the corresponding metric can be linked to the traditional notions of Epxlainability or Interpretability in Machine Learning;
 Finally,
 the column 
\emph on
