rectangles
\emph default
 correspond to the areas of expertise of local expert agents.
 Each agent have a different type of internal models (
\begin_inset Formula $f_{1},\,f_{2},\,f_{3}$
\end_inset

),
 as illustrated by the 3 plots on top of the diagram.
 The 
