\begin_layout Standard
We introduced the CELL (Context Ensemble Local Learning) formalism and developed online learning algorithms based on ensembles of local expert agents self-organizing from social rules to continuously model the behavior of the vehicle driver by a human driver.
 Chapter 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "chap:Context-Ensemble-Local"
