 Safe and Trustworthy Intelligent Speed Recommendation Systems] How do the works of this thesis solve some of the requirements ?
\end_layout

\begin_deeper
\begin_layout Itemize
[
\series bold
Safety
\series default
] Traditionally when using learned predictive models it's not sure that the model is reliable for OoD data => However our learning system is able to estimate epistemic uncertainty by leevraging the spatialization of local expert agents in input space,
 making the system 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

know when it does not know
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

 => which could allow for triggering the use of fallback simpler strategies when the model is not reliable => Chapter 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "chap:Solving-Control-Tasks"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

 showed that the introspective properties of kCELL demonstrated in Chapter 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "chap:Context-Ensemble-Local"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

 could be leveraged to improve the reliability of the predictions of the learned model.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
[
\series bold
Certifiabilit
\series default
y] => In Chapter 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "chap:Solving-Control-Tasks"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

 we demonstrate that kCELL can successfully be integrated with QP solvers like OSQP or qpAOSES in a MPC control loop => QP solvers offer strong guarantees in terms of bounded complexity and worst-case execution times.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
[
\series bold
Certifiability
\series default
] => Continuously learning components violate core assumptions of standards like ISO 26262,
 which requires fixed,
 verifiable designs with full traceability from requirements to implementation.
 Changes in model parameters (e.g.,
 via gradient updates) can alter decision boundaries unpredictably,
 risking regression in safety performance or emergence of new failure modes outside the original training distribution => in CELL systems forgetting of useful information is mitigated by Parameter Isolation => Parameter Isolation also provides Contextual Integrity => In an industrial ODD (Operational Design Domain),
 a system should not apply "Highway behavior" in a "School Zone." => in kCELL the spatialization of local experts acts as a structural guardrail ensuring that the model used for recommendations is always the one learned in the relevant environment,
 preventing dangerouse 
